    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The oversized editorial claim and 25.60× ROI dial create a clear focal point across all viewports, but the dominant visual language—dark cards, neon status pills, ledger rows, cyan/red metrics, and a simple gauge—remains familiar cybersecurity-dashboard styling. The proposed-control card adds information rather than a distinctive visual idea, and the global header reinforces the same generic command-console aesthetic.",
